  "external_primary_provenance": "PR #6509 and #6619 provide the conserved pair operator and outward-slack question. CubeJerry's PR #6778 proves universal same-map row/column noncommutation for globally Gaussian-unit-covariant maps exact on integral ideal images; our map meets those hypotheses at n=1. The current global-half branch at 26226aa52337e6e94bc0cdf3cf6b89d16bb42f5f is related work under a different, less constrained contract. Exact head pins, paths, Git blobs and SHA-256 values are listed above.",
  "local_inputs": "All executable checkers and proof artifacts are package-local. VERIFY.json declares no external inputs or runtime dependencies.",
  "role_boundary": "The root supplied the candidate formula and separate Fraction checker; the proof/integer checker role formalized the same formula. See ROLE-BOUNDARIES.md; this is not blind or formal review.",
